{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1540372-enhancement-background","id":1540372,"title":"Enhancement $ (Background)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-08-14T11:21:09-07:00","id":1540372,"title":"Enhancement $ (Background)","content":"My question is rather simple.<br /> Do you get additional Permanent Paradox if your Enhancements boost your Attributes above 5? on top of what you already pay?<br /> <br /> Example:<br /> John has a Strength rating of 5, and 2 dots of Cybernetic Enhancements.<br /> His Cybernetic arms provide him with +2 dots of Strength, making it a total of 7.<br /> Does John receive only 2 Permanent Paradox, or he receives 4? (Two from the Enhancements, and two from exceeding 5).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25177-lirbo","name":"Lirbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25177_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-14T12:14:31-07:00","id":1540377,"title":"","content":"I that's on the ST to decide, but I would have it be 3 or the whole 4. Part because you bought Attributes with BG, part because you exceed 5.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-20T10:40:35-07:00","id":1540789,"title":"","content":"It was my interpretation that the Background already takes the Permadox in count. It's a very unnatural modification of your Pattern already, better not to pay twice for it.<br /> <br /> Otherwise Cybernetics it's the worst way to increase your attributes ever. You can't pay the Permadox off with &quot;half-xp&quot; if you increased below 5, and it costs x2 above 5.<br /> <br /> I would have it cost 2 Permadox flat, and say that you can still raise your attributes with xp as if you didn't have the Trait (that is: you don't have 7 Strength, you have Str 5 + 2 - this also means you need more successes to raise it further with magick, which goes well with how &quot;magick to raise attributes&quot; usually works, as it doesn't stack). The only exploit I can think off could be taking &quot;genetic flaws&quot; instead, but these are odd in themselves<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}